          "delta_ms": 14.606542070396245,
          "chunk": " Role\n\nA State Traverser navigates nested JSON/object structures in LLM responses to extract or validate specific fields at arbitrary depths.\n\n# Minimal JSON Example\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rule\": {\n    \"type\": \"extraction\",\n    \"path\": \"choices.0.delta.content\",\n    \"target\": \"streamed_token\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThis rule extracts the content from the first choice's delta object in a streaming response and stores it in the `streamed_token` field.",
